{'symbol': 'PEG', 'date': '2022-06-30 11:00:00', 'title': 'PSEG LONG ISLAND OFFERS PAYMENT PLANS, OTHER ASSISTANCE TO HELP AVOID SHUTOFFS', 'text': 'AS SHUTOFFS RESUME AFTER MORE THAN TWO YEARS, LOW- AND MODERATE-INCOME CUSTOMERS WILL CONTINUE TO HAVE ASSISTANCE WITH BILLS AND MAY BE ELIGIBLE FOR NEW PROTECTIONS UNIONDALE, N.Y. , JUNE 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UTILITY SERVICE SHUTOFFS FOR NONPAYMENT HAVE BEGUN TO RESUME ACROSS NEW YORK STATE, AND PSEG LONG ISLAND EXPECTS TO RESUME SHUTOFFS ON JULY 12.'}